===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈpɹəʊtʃ/|a=UK}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈpɹoʊt͡ʃ/|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-reproach.ogg|a=US}}
