* {{rhymes|en|əʊtʃ|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[mild]] [[rebuke]], or an [[implied]] [[criticism]].
#* {{quote-book| 1=en| year=1818| author=w:Mary Shelley| title=w:Frankenstein| chapter=4| url=http://ebooks.adelaide.edu.au/s/shelley/mary/s53f/chapter4.html| passage=My father made no '''reproach''' in his letters and only took notice of my science by inquiring into my occupations more particularly than before.| archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20111030141018/http://ebooks.adelaide.edu.au/s/shelley/mary/s53f/chapter4.html| archivedate=30 October 2011}}
# [[disgrace|Disgrace]] or [[shame]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} An object of [[scorn]]. <!--Chambers 1908-->

